---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Section from "../components/Section.astro";
import Heading from "../components/Heading.astro";

import muralPhoto from "../assets/james-mural.jpg";
---

<Layout>
  <main>
    <Section className="wrapper flow prose">
      <Heading level={2} emphasis>Hi, I’m James</Heading>

      <div
        class="grid"
        style="--grid-placement: auto-fit; --gutter: var(--space-xl);"
      >
        <figure>
          <img
            src={muralPhoto.src}
            alt="James Button playing his Marigaux oboe"
            width={888}
            height={888}
          />
        </figure>
        <div class="flow prose">
          <p>
            James Button was appointed Associate Principal Oboe of the San
            Francisco Symphony in September 2017. A native of Australia, he made
            his solo debut with the Melbourne Symphony Orchestra at the age of
            seventeen.
          </p>

          <p>
            Mr. Button studied at Temple University and the Juilliard School,
            where his principal teachers included Jonathan Blumenfeld and Eugene
            Izotov. He has also studied with John Mack, John de Lancie, and
            Joseph Turner.
          </p>

          <p>
            Prior to joining the San Francisco Symphony, Mr. Button was a member
            of the Nashville Symphony, the Santa Fe Opera Orchestra, and the New
            World Symphony. He has appeared as Guest Principal Oboe with the
            Chicago Symphony Orchestra, Philadelphia Orchestra, and Los Angeles
            Philharmonic.
          </p>

          <p>
            An active performer both nationally and internationally, Mr. Button
            has appeared at the Verbier, Edinburgh, and Tanglewood Music
            Festivals, as well as Italy’s Spoleto Festival dei Due Mondi and the
            Santa Fe Chamber Music Festival. His live recording of Jennifer
            Higdon’s Oboe Concerto with the Nashville Symphony received a Grammy
            Award in 2018.
          </p>

          <p>
            In addition to his orchestral career, Mr. Button has enjoyed a
            diverse freelance career, including recording projects with Björk
            and Willie Nelson, performances on Broadway in Fiddler on the Roof,
            and guest principal appearances with his hometown orchestra, the
            Melbourne Symphony Orchestra.
          </p>

          <p>
            Mr. Button is a Marigaux artist and performs on a 920A model oboe.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </Section>
  </main>
</Layout>
